| check | result |
|---|---|
| exact gate replay (`logs/gate_repair_replay.py`, all 68 `.lean`, cwd = root) | **68/68 exit 0** (255.8 s) |
| per-file `lake env lean` (Interface/Props/Toy/AxiomAudit) | 0 (2.83/3.54/2.64/2.87 s) |
| axiom audit | 31 declarations, all cones `{propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound}`, 0 non-standard |
| forbidden tokens in authored files | `sorry`/`admit`/`unsafe`/`native_decide`/`proof_wanted`/`axiom` declarations all 0 |

**Harness confirmation:** its own gate wrote `state/D9-tensor-algebra-manifolds/gate.json` with `ok: true`, 68 files, 0 failures, and `dispatch.log` records `2026-09-10T10:04:27+0800 PROMOTE D9-tensor-algebra-manifolds verified (gate 68 files)`.

